      "text": "Mount Enterprise earned its name from a nearby hill and the entrepreneurial Vinson brothers who settled there in 1832.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/mount-enterprise-tx-rusk-county"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Lumbering drove early growth, with a furniture factory operating as early as 1850.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Enterprise%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When the Texas and New Orleans Railroad came within 1½ miles, Mount Enterprise relocated to sit beside it.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
