      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/mount-enterprise-tx-rusk-county"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "City officials emphasize small‑town values, guided growth, and preserving Mount Enterprise’s historical, cultural, and natural heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
